  "description": "With the Altura CP City Plus, you get a unisex electric bike with a low step-through frame and a unique large front basket featuring a fixed base and a handlebar lock. The handlebar lock is very practical when parking the bike with a heavily loaded front basket. The design is simple and stylish. Overall, this bike — equipped with the powerful Bosch Active Line Plus motor and a battery mounted on the luggage carrier — is ideal for those who want strong support on hills and in headwinds.\n\nThe low step-through frame makes it easy to get on and off the bike, even when it is loaded with cargo in both the front basket and on the rear carrier. It is the ideal bike for everyday rides as well as longer, relaxed weekend trips.\n\nThis bike is available in cooperation with Fri Bikeshop.",
